{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgg24s2FNir7wmuA9jwh7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"For [Cr(NH₃)₆]³⁺ I get **Dq = 2155 cm⁻¹, B ≈ 657 cm⁻¹ and C ≈ 3700 cm⁻¹**. Dq and B come exactly from the two spin-allowed bands. C is approximate because it uses a second-order formula for the ²E level.\n\n**1. Dq from the ⁴A₂g → ⁴T₂g band**\n\nFor d³ in an octahedral field, this transition energy equals 10Dq exactly:\n10Dq = 21 550 cm⁻¹, so **Dq = 2155 cm⁻¹**.\n\n**2. B from the ⁴A₂g → ⁴T₁g(F) band**\n\nThe energy of this band is:\nE(⁴T₁) = 15Dq + 7.5B − ½√(225B² − 180B·Dq + 100Dq²)\n\n- Set E(⁴T₁) = 28 500 cm⁻¹. Since 15Dq = 32 325 cm⁻¹, this gives 28 500 − 32 325 = −3825 = 7.5B − ½√(…).\n- Rearranging: √(…) = 15B + 7650.\n- Squaring both sides: 225B² − 387 900B + 464 402 500 = 225B² + 229 500B + 58 522 500.\n- The B² terms cancel, leaving 617 400B = 405 880 000.\n- So **B ≈ 657 cm⁻¹**. This is about 64 % of the free-ion Cr³⁺ value (about 1030 cm⁻¹).\n\n**3. C from the spin-forbidden ⁴A₂g → ²Eg band**\n\nI used the strong-field expression with the second-order correction for t₂g²e_g mixing:\nE(²E) ≈ 9B + 3C − 90B²/(10Dq)\n\n- 9B = 5917 cm⁻¹.\n- 90B²/(10Dq) = 90 × 657.4² / 21 550 ≈ 1805 cm⁻¹.\n- So 15 200 = 5917 + 3C − 1805, which gives 3C = 11 088 and **C ≈ 3700 cm⁻¹**.\n- This gives C/B ≈ 5.6, which is a reasonable ratio for Cr(III).\n\n**Limitation on C:** C depends on the approximate ²E formula. If you drop the second-order correction and use E(²E) ≈ 9B + 3C, you get C ≈ 3090 cm⁻¹. An exact value would require diagonalising the full d³ ²E energy matrix, which I did not do.\n\n{\"Dq\": 2155, \"B\": 657, \"C\": 3700, \"out_of_scope\": false, \"reason\": \"Dq and B are exact from the quartet bands; C uses the approximation E(2E) = 9B + 3C - 90B^2/10Dq.\"}"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":820,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":820,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e4153cfe-ad1d-4041-a488-80d03e6c6880","uuid":"83b3a3e4-22da-4ee0-af49-4720e005308d","timestamp":"2026-11-03T12:47:18.872Z","request_id":"req_011Cgg24rfvDMX3jkgRUoDFi"}
